-- חוזר לבעלויות תש"פ/6 (1.4.2020): הסכם קיבוצי מיוחד מיום 31.3.2020 – עובדי
-- הוראה במכללות להכשרת עובדי הוראה בתקופת חירום (נגיף הקורונה).
-- The special agreement for teacher-college teaching staff during the
-- coronavirus emergency: who it covers, the duty to go on teaching, salary
-- unchanged, no extra pay for deferred work, reporting, and pay reduction
-- with an appeal.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT common
IMPORT daydate

§ `תש"פ/6 הסכם קיבוצי מיוחד 31.3.2020 – מכללות להכשרת עובדי הוראה בתקופת חירום`

-- akn:preamble The letterhead, date, reference number, addressee, greeting and subject line; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p13 The recital that the State and the Teachers' Union signed the special agreement on 31.3.2020 ("the agreement"); no rule.

-- The college and its officers are actors this circular names and the
-- takanon's common Party does not, so they are declared here.
DECLARE `college party` IS ONE OF
    `the teaching employee at the college`
    `the college`
    `the college director`
    `the authorised appeals body`

@desc A teaching employee at a teacher-training college, as far as this circular asks.
DECLARE `college employee` HAS
    `employed at a teacher-training college`          IS A BOOLEAN
    `graded on the teaching-employee scale`           IS A BOOLEAN
    `salary computed by the teachers' agreements`     IS A BOOLEAN @desc salary computed under the collective agreements for teaching employees
    `employed in the state service`                   IS A BOOLEAN
    `the college signed the joining letter`           IS A BOOLEAN @desc the college signed the letter of joining in the form of the agreement's annex A
    `position fraction at the college`                IS A NUMBER  @desc the share of a full position held at the college

DECLARE `college action` IS ONE OF
    `send the signed joining letter to the labour-relations commissioner with a copy to the Ministry`
    `perform the semester B academic duties`
    `complete the deferred academic duties`
    `report a duty prevented to the director`
    `decide the employee did not meet section 3`
    `appeal the director's decision`
    `decide the appeal`
    `name the appeals body and notify the Ministry in writing`
    `reduce the consideration` HAS `days after the decision` IS A NUMBER

§§ `1 Who the agreement covers`

@ref akn:art_1/p1 akn:art_1__para_a/p1 akn:art_1__para_b/p1 akn:art_1__para_b/p2
GIVEN e IS A `college employee`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the agreement covers` e IF
        e's `employed at a teacher-training college`
    AND e's `graded on the teaching-employee scale`
    AND e's `salary computed by the teachers' agreements`
    AND (   e's `employed in the state service`
         OR e's `the college signed the joining letter`)

-- §1 ¶2–3: the college sends the signed joining letter to the labour-relations
-- commissioner at the Ministry of Labour (by e-mail), with a copy to the
-- Ministry of Education's named official. No deadline is printed.
@ref akn:art_1/p2 akn:art_1/p3
GIVEN `the college joins` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A DEONTIC `college party` `college action`
DECIDE `sending the joining letter` `the college joins` IS
    IF `the college joins`
    THEN PARTY `the college`
         MUST  `send the signed joining letter to the labour-relations commissioner with a copy to the Ministry`
         LEST BREACH BY `the college` BECAUSE "תש\"פ/6 §1: the signed joining letter is sent to the commissioner, with a copy to the Ministry"
    ELSE FULFILLED

§§ `2 The agreement's period`

-- §2 ¶1: from the Restriction Order's entry into force (15.3.2020) to the
-- start of academic year תשפ"א, whose date the circular does not print; it
-- also governs instructions to be carried out after that period.
@ref akn:art_2/p1
`the agreement period begins` MEANS Date 15 3 2020

@desc The first day of academic year תשפ"א (2020-2021) at the college; not printed in the circular.
ASSUME `the start of academic year תשפ"א` IS A DATE

@ref akn:art_2/p1
GIVEN d IS A DATE, `an instruction to be carried out after the period` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the agreement governs` d `an instruction to be carried out after the period` IF
       (    d AT LEAST `the agreement period begins`
        AND d LESS THAN `the start of academic year תשפ"א`)
    OR `an instruction to be carried out after the period`

-- §2 ¶2: only the share of the position held at the college.
@ref akn:art_2/p2
GIVEN e IS A `college employee`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the position the agreement governs` e IS e's `position fraction at the college`

§§ `3–4 Academic duties and pay`

-- §3 ¶1–2: every semester-B duty goes on — lessons, exercises, labs, tours,
-- exams, office hours, grading, committees, online teaching and any duty the
-- institution imposes — "חובות ומטלות אקדמיות". The paragraph sets no time
-- limit of its own: what semester B leaves undone ¶3 defers.
@ref akn:art_3/p1 akn:art_3/p2
GIVETH A DEONTIC `college party` `college action`
DECIDE `continuing the academic duties` IS
    PARTY `the teaching employee at the college`
    MUST  `perform the semester B academic duties`
    LEST BREACH BY `the teaching employee at the college` BECAUSE "תש\"פ/6 §3: the semester B academic duties continue"

-- §3 ¶3: duties not done in semester B are completed in full by the start of
-- academic year תשפ"א, notwithstanding any holiday arrangement.
@ref akn:art_3/p3
GIVEN `days to the start of תשפ"א` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A DEONTIC `college party` `college action`
DECIDE `completing the deferred duties` `days to the start of תשפ"א` IS
    PARTY `the teaching employee at the college`
    MUST  `complete the deferred academic duties`
    WITHIN `days to the start of תשפ"א`
    LEST BREACH BY `the teaching employee at the college` BECAUSE "תש\"פ/6 §3: deferred academic duties are completed by the start of תשפ\"א"

-- §3 ¶4: semester B salary is unchanged ("התמורה"); components that depend
-- on reporting (travel allowance among them) keep their own rules.
@ref akn:art_3/p4
GIVEN `salary for full performance in semester B` IS A NUMBER
      `report-dependent components as reported` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the consideration` `salary for full performance in semester B` `report-dependent components as reported` IS
    `salary for full performance in semester B`

-- §4: no pay beyond the consideration for deferred duties, even when they
-- fall when no teaching would have been held, or after semester B.
@ref akn:art_4/p1 akn:art_4/p2
GIVEN `pay claimed for deferred duties` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `extra pay for deferred duties` `pay claimed for deferred duties` IS 0

§§ `5–6 Reporting and reduction`

-- §5: report to "the director" every duty prevented. F-2019-20_tashaf_06-b: the
-- circular never says who "the director" is.
@ref akn:art_5/p1
GIVETH A DEONTIC `college party` `college action`
DECIDE `reporting prevented duties` IS
    PARTY `the teaching employee at the college`
    MUST  `report a duty prevented to the director`
    LEST BREACH BY `the teaching employee at the college` BECAUSE "תש\"פ/6 §5: every prevented duty is reported to the director"

-- §6(א): where the director finds §3 was not met, the institution reduces
-- the consideration in proportion, or deducts from any sum due — the final
-- settlement included. The share not performed is an input.
@ref akn:art_6__para_a/p1
GIVEN `the consideration due` IS A NUMBER
      `share of the duties not performed` IS A NUMBER @desc the share of the section 3 duties the director found unperformed
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the reduced consideration` `the consideration due` `share of the duties not performed` IS
    `the consideration due` TIMES (1 MINUS `share of the duties not performed`)

-- §6(ב): an appeal within 7 days to a body the college names; each college
-- names it and notifies the Ministry's named official in writing by
-- 7.4.2020 ("הגורם המוסמך").
@ref akn:art_6__para_b/p1
GIVETH A DEONTIC `college party` `college action`
DECIDE `the appeal window` IS
    PARTY `the teaching employee at the college`
    MAY   `appeal the director's decision`
    WITHIN 7

-- Days from 1.4.2020, the circular's date: 7.4.2020 is day 6.
@ref akn:art_6__para_b/p1
GIVETH A DEONTIC `college party` `college action`
DECIDE `naming the appeals body` IS
    PARTY `the college`
    MUST  `name the appeals body and notify the Ministry in writing`
    WITHIN 6
    LEST BREACH BY `the college` BECAUSE "תש\"פ/6 §6(ב): the appeals body is named and notified by 7.4.2020"

-- §6(ג): the reduction is made "לא פחות מחלוף 8 ימים" after the director's
-- decision if there is no appeal, "או תוך יומיים" after the appeals body's
-- decision. F-2019-20_tashaf_06-a: the first is an earliest day, the second reads as
-- a latest day — or as an earliest day like the first. The reading adopted:
-- both are waiting periods (no reduction earlier than 8 days, or than 2 days
-- after the appeal decision), the reading under which an employee's appeal
-- right is protected in both branches.
@ref akn:art_6__para_c/p1
GIVEN o IS AN `appeal outcome`, day IS A NUMBER @desc days after the director's decision
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the reduction may be made on day` o day IF
    day AT LEAST `the earliest day of the reduction` o

DECLARE `appeal outcome` IS ONE OF
    `no appeal`
    `appeal decided` HAS `days from director's decision to appeal decision` IS A NUMBER

GIVEN o IS AN `appeal outcome`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the earliest day of the reduction` o IS
    CONSIDER o
    WHEN `no appeal` THEN 8
    WHEN `appeal decided` n THEN n PLUS 2

-- akn:art_6__para_c/p2 akn:art_6__para_c__subpara_1 akn:art_6__para_c__subpara_2 akn:art_6__para_c__subpara_3 The list of enclosures (the agreement, the joining letter, the deputy director-general's letter on appeals); sent with the circular and not part of its text, so annex A's joining letter is not encoded here.

-- akn:conclusions The sign-off, signatures and copies list; no rule.

§§ `Worked examples`

-- Examples.
`a college lecturer in a joined college` MEANS
    `college employee` WITH
        `employed at a teacher-training college`      IS TRUE
        `graded on the teaching-employee scale`       IS TRUE
        `salary computed by the teachers' agreements` IS TRUE
        `employed in the state service`               IS FALSE
        `the college signed the joining letter`       IS TRUE
        `position fraction at the college`            IS 0.6

`a lecturer whose college did not join` MEANS
    `college employee` WITH
        `employed at a teacher-training college`      IS TRUE
        `graded on the teaching-employee scale`       IS TRUE
        `salary computed by the teachers' agreements` IS TRUE
        `employed in the state service`               IS FALSE
        `the college signed the joining letter`       IS FALSE
        `position fraction at the college`            IS 1

#ASSERT `the agreement covers` `a college lecturer in a joined college`
#ASSERT NOT `the agreement covers` `a lecturer whose college did not join`
#ASSERT `the position the agreement governs` `a college lecturer in a joined college` EQUALS 0.6
#ASSERT `the reduced consideration` 10000 0.25 EQUALS 7500
#ASSERT NOT `the reduction may be made on day` `no appeal` 7
#ASSERT `the reduction may be made on day` `no appeal` 8
#ASSERT `extra pay for deferred duties` 2000 EQUALS 0

-- The appeals body named on 6.4.2020 (day 5): met. Named on 8.4.2020: breached.
#TRACE `naming the appeals body` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the college` DOES `name the appeals body and notify the Ministry in writing` AT 5
#TRACE `naming the appeals body` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the college` DOES `name the appeals body and notify the Ministry in writing` AT 7

-- The findings' evidence.
`the circular names who "the director" is` MEANS FALSE
`"the director" is used in sections 5 and 6 and defined nowhere` MEANS
    (NOT `the circular names who "the director" is`)
#ASSERT `"the director" is used in sections 5 and 6 and defined nowhere`

-- The other reading: "תוך יומיים" as a deadline. A reduction on day 5 of an
-- appeal decided on day 2 is then too late, yet allowed under the reading above.
GIVEN n IS A NUMBER, day IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `"within two days" read as a deadline allows day` n day IF
    day AT MOST n PLUS 2

`§6(ג)'s two limits read two ways for an appeal` MEANS
        `the reduction may be made on day` (`appeal decided` 2) 5
    AND (NOT `"within two days" read as a deadline allows day` 2 5)
#ASSERT `§6(ג)'s two limits read two ways for an appeal`
